          "text": "Yeah. Seventy five Hoyt Street. The zip is one one two zero one.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I have your home at 75 Hoit Street, Brooklyn 11201, and the best number is (347) 555-0213. Is that right?",
