          "text": "Yeah. That's correct. Seventy five Hoyt Street, Brooklyn. And the number, that's my cell. Five five five, oh two one three. Wait, no. Hold on. It's, uh... three four seven, five five five, oh two one three. Yeah.",
          "said": null
