          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Wait. Monday? I didn't book anything Monday. And I said Hoyt, not, uh... what's the visit for? I just want the address changed.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sorry about that. The visit on your account is a no heat visit from November 2 scheduled for Monday between twelve and four. I can't see who booked it or why it was set up. I only changed the address.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Okay. Well, I don't need a Monday visit. Is that all? Or is there... I also need an AC tune-up. Can you do that?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I can book an AC tune up. Since you don't need the Monday visit, do you want me to cancel it or leave it in place for now?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Cancel it. I don't need it. But, uh, wait, is it for the old place or the new place? No, never mind. Just cancel it. And the AC tune-up, can you do it Friday afternoon?",
