          "text": "Sorry about that. Let me check Friday afternoon for the AC tune up. Friday, I have twelve to four. Does that work?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. Friday, twelve to four. That works. But, uh, wait, you also said something about a callback earlier? Can someone call me back tomorrow? At two PM, exactly.",
